### HTTP requests for IntelliJ HTTP Client

@base = http://127.0.0.1:48121

### Health
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### Create project
# @name createProject
POST {{base}}/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Клиент А",
  "description": "Сопровождение продукта"
}

### List projects
GET {{base}}/api/v1/projects

### Create time entry
POST {{base}}/api/v1/time-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "{{createProject.response.body.id}}",
  "startedAt": "2026-09-01T09:00:00Z",
  "endedAt": "2026-09-01T11:30:00Z",
  "note": "Созвон и правки"
}

### Create income
POST {{base}}/api/v1/money-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "{{createProject.response.body.id}}",
  "direction": "INCOME",
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "currency": "RUB",
  "occurredOn": "2026-09-01",
  "category": "invoice",
  "note": "Аванс"
}

### Create expense
POST {{base}}/api/v1/money-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "{{createProject.response.body.id}}",
  "direction": "EXPENSE",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "RUB",
  "occurredOn": "2026-09-01",
  "category": "software",
  "note": "Подписка"
}

### Summary
GET {{base}}/api/v1/summary?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
